  "notes": "### Agents send GIFs that pop up\n\n- **An agent's GIF shows as a picture, like yours.** When an agent puts a GIF address in its reply, as an image, a link or the bare address, the GIF is fetched into the chat and pops up in its bubble on the phone and in the window, with the words beside it kept and the link gone; an address that could not be fetched stays a link.\n- **Agents can search for a GIF.** On the phone link, every agent has a `gif_search` tool: a few words in, real GIPHY addresses out, searched by desktop Mimir with the key you pasted (the key never reaches the agent). The Well engine and the Claude and Codex lanes all have it; Kimi, Gemini and Ares do not.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **A message resent into a mission's chat is taken once.** When a phone lost the answer to a message it wrote in a mission's chat and sent it again under the same request, the change of direction was filed twice. The link now remembers the request and answers the resend with the change it already took (a different message under the same request is refused, as in every other chat).",
